ent","s":"Bharat Masrani","x":"First, with declining rates and heightened macro concerns pointing to a more subdued outlook for industry revenue growth, we took some restructuring charges this quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/05/the-toronto-dominion-bank-td-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"TD 2019 Q4","e":"td","d":"2019-12-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bharat Masrani","x":"Rounding out the picture, our Wholesale Bank earned CAD608 million this year, book ended by market volatility in Q1 and derivative valuation and restructuring charges this quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/05/the-toronto-dominion-bank-td-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"TD 2020 Q1","e":"td","d":"2020-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Riaz Ahmed","x":"I think as to the matter of restructuring charge, you will recall that in Q4, I said that our restructuring charge was not particularly related to expense savings or productivity but was a continuing exercise in optimizing processes and procedures that we've been building as we undertake the…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/27/the-toronto-dominion-bank-td-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"TD 2020 Q1","e":"td","d":"2020-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Riaz Ahmed","x":"…disruption, the investments that we're making in omnichannel delivery of our products and services to our customers, the changes in the environment, may from time to time cause us to review how we do business, and it could be that we may see restructuring charges in that order from time to time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/27/the-toronto-dominion-bank-td-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"TD 2020 Q2","e":"td","d":"2020-05-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Greg Braca","x":"…it gets a little bit more complicated because obviously mortgages that are sold into the secondary market, the GSEs are involved and there is some guidance around that, that allows for restructuring after the 90 days either to the back end of the loan or a complete restructuring of the loan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/28/toronto-dominion-bank-td-q2-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"TD 2020 Q4","e":"td","d":"2020-12-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Riaz Ahmed","x":"The increase in net corporate expenses reflects the impact of corporate real estate optimization cost of CAD163 million in the current quarter compared with restructuring charges of CAD51 million in the same quarter last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/12/03/toronto-dominion-bank-td-q4-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"TD 2021 Q1","e":"td","d":"2021-02-26","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Bharat Masrani","x":"And in our insurance business, our direct-to-consumer digital-first offering continued to drive strong customer acquisition and premium growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/td-bank-group-td-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TD 2021 Q1","e":"td","d":"2021-02-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bharat Masrani","x":"And I'm going to pass it on to Teri to talk about the Canadian business, and then Greg perhaps can comment on the U.S., and then I'll come back and provide you an overall view.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/td-bank-group-td-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TD 2021 Q1","e":"td","d":"2021-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Paul Holden","x":"What I want to ask you about is what is the expected cost savings on the other side?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/td-bank-group-td-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TD 2021 Q1","e":"td","d":"2021-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Paul Holden","x":"We did have a notable item, obviously, in the quarter for a store restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/td-bank-group-td-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TD 2021 Q2","e":"td","d":"2021-05-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Teri Currie","x":"I think -- and Riaz said that when we look at the business overall, we're making the investments we need to grow the business, to create efficiencies, to generate cost savings over time as well as customer efficiencies and capabilities and colleague efficiencies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/29/the-toronto-dominion-bank-td-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"TD 2021 Q3","e":"td","d":"2021-08-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bharat Masrani","x":"Let me just, just from an overall bank perspective Doug, this is Bharat and then pass it on to Teri and Greg to talk about each of our major businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/27/the-toronto-dominion-bank-td-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"TD 2021 Q4","e":"td","d":"2021-12-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bharat Masrani","x":"I'll pass it on to Greg.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/12/03/the-toronto-dominion-bank-td-q4-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"TD 2021 Q4","e":"td","d":"2021-12-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Darko Mihelic","x":"And is it fair to say that, there's going to be a period here of sort of significant review and potentially restructuring charges in 2022 or something of that sort or do you think that's way off pace that line of thinking and we should really just not think about large changes in the year ahead?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/12/03/the-toronto-dominion-bank-td-q4-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"TD 2026 Q2","e":"td","d":"2026-05-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Raymond Chun","x":"The bank is driving structural cost reductions, enabling the team to deliver the smallest expense growth since 2022, while at the same time, accelerating investments 