s across AI, innovation and frontline talent.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/31/td-td-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TD 2026 Q3","e":"td","d":"2026-08-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ajai Bambawale","x":"And we've also been prudent, and I tried to bring that point out in my prepared remarks, and you just think about tariffs, okay?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/31/td-td-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TD 2026 Q3","e":"td","d":"2026-08-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ajai Bambawale","x":"Right out of the gate, we went and said, where could this tariff story go?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/31/td-td-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TD 2026 Q3","e":"td","d":"2026-08-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raymond Chun","x":"We are on track for our $2 billion to $2.5 billion medium-term structural cost reduction target that we shared at Investor Day and, in fact, see potential upside as we fundamentally reset the cost base of the bank.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/31/td-td-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TD 2026 Q3","e":"td","d":"2026-08-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raymond Chun","x":"We are scaling AI in our credit journeys to streamline application submission, automate document review processes and accelerate speed to decision.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/31/td-td-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[31,1,9101,0,0,0,7354,1279],[32,1,9943,0,0,0,6817,2479],[33,1,9293,0,0,0,6942,1882],[34,1,9260,0,0,0,7058,1713],[36,1,9055,0,0,0,7163,1488],[37,1,9983,0,0,0,6873,2548],[38,1,8824,0,0,0,6625,1683],[39,1,7323,0,0,0,5343,1560],[40,1,8501,0,0,0,6362,1718],[41,1,11646,0,0,0,8886,2220],[42,1,8970,0,0,0,7072,1446],[43,1,8304,0,0,0,6938,914],[44,1,9043,0,0,0,6982,1639],[45,1,10541,0,0,0,6601,3351],[46,1,10851,0,0,0,8276,2125]